{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$g : \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0004": "$g$", "MATH_0005": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-compact-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8e65fd2cd4516bb493f477762093f251a5b08595dc790e695f999360969dcc5e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e292f0e332771734dc7f9210ede9bb8b64ed25161bceb389f72a1f30293bb5b4", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and\n<MATH_0002> be morphisms of algebraic stacks.\nIf <MATH_0003> is quasi-compact and <MATH_0004> is quasi-separated\nthen <MATH_0005> is quasi-compact.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1e23b082357427725877abda373599ab4078fc2d4f0b173f7b0e158cfc39f407", "unit_id": "tag:050Y:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$(1, f) : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y} \\to\n\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Z} \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0004": "$g$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-section-immersion}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-separated}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-quasi-compact}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-composition-quasi-compact}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4ad901839f085fa536040173c8a5249430e535bf79e4ee357b137071ccc9fcdb", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:981e3695c3f74945c940cfab0139a4a7fdf96470a9409ebe4e072624602272e4", "source_text": "This is true because <MATH_0001> equals the composition\n<MATH_0002>.\nThe first map is quasi-compact by\nLemma <REF_0001>\nbecause it is a section of the quasi-separated morphism\n<MATH_0003>\n(a base change of <MATH_0004>, see\nLemma <REF_0002>).\nThe second map is quasi-compact as it is the base change of <MATH_0005>, see\nLemma <REF_0003>.\nAnd compositions of quasi-compact\nmorphisms are quasi-compact, see Lemma <REF_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6aefa7421b1b3b8b08af121ac6d0a2309a046b6e479256e27e4b8e1f71e9777e", "unit_id": "tag:050Y:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-compact-quasi-separated-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8b3f58af414335a14397085c383b148fd5ece8c1674aa789123de00c99e8d9d8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ceed0065339db9f59b253c7e6a8766ce4bae0e7d86365f949080e322f81d3d71", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> If <MATH_0002> is quasi-compact and <MATH_0003> is\nquasi-separated, then <MATH_0004> is quasi-compact.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0005> is quasi-compact and quasi-separated and <MATH_0006>\nis quasi-separated, then <MATH_0007> is quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\n<STRUCT_0004> A fibre product of quasi-compact and quasi-separated algebraic stacks\nis quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5e217c71bb19238f585ab3cba98f2983750757c09b931f7bb377ecd7a092bfd6", "unit_id": "tag:075S:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "050S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{Z}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-quasi-compact-permanence}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-compose-after-separated}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-quasi-compact}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-separated}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-separated-over-separated}", "REF_0006": "\\ref{lemma-composition-quasi-compact}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:746bd3aa8209c0916b4078fa4f98c7f6ec95a9763d96bb12849e518d626fd24e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6fc6dff2696b35105a15be54289d4670c9597813f0e02777a9df8ac3b4a38a75", "source_text": "Part (1) follows from\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nPart (2) follows from (1) and\nLemma <REF_0002>.\nFor (3) let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002>\nbe morphisms of quasi-compact and quasi-separated algebraic stacks.\nThen <MATH_0003>\nis quasi-compact and quasi-separated as a base change of\n<MATH_0004> using (2) and\nLemmas <REF_0003> and\n<REF_0004>.\nHence <MATH_0005>\nis quasi-compact and quasi-separated as\nan algebraic stack quasi-compact and quasi-separated over\n<MATH_0006>, see\nLemmas <REF_0005> and\n<REF_0006>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0ffafe325cd6152d5717225526b455ec9e6b68b13a0b3f1ef5dd193698c86778", "unit_id": "tag:075S:proof"}
